  "description": "Discover Little Perle: A Masterpiece of Dutch Craftsmanship\nDelivered in 2008 by the acclaimed Dutch yacht builder Moonen, Little Perle is a 30-metre superyacht designed for those who seek both adventure and refinement. With exterior styling by Rene Van Der Velden and interiors by Art-Line, this exceptional vessel exudes timeless elegance. A standout in the world of luxury charters, Little Perle is more than a yacht—she’s a floating sanctuary crafted to deliver unforgettable moments at sea.\n\nEntertain in Elegance, Relax in Luxury\nThe wide main salon welcomes guests with an inviting blend of comfort and sophistication, featuring plush seating and a grand formal dining area. Step aft to enjoy al fresco dining for up to nine guests, where the ocean breeze enhances every occasion. On the flybridge, a Jacuzzi, full-service bar, and expansive sun lounges create a sanctuary for both day and night cruising, ideal for entertaining in true style.\n\nSpace, Style and Seamless Service\nAccommodating up to eight guests overnight across four beautifully appointed cabins—including a Master suite, VIP cabin, and two Twins with a Pullman—Little Perle is perfect for families and private groups. With a generous cruising capacity for up to 36 guests, she’s also ideal for larger celebrations and corporate events. Every charter is elevated by a professional crew and experienced captain, ensuring every moment aboard Little Perle is effortless, elegant, and entirely unforgettable.\n",
